  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till H&#xf6;gsta domstolen som del av svenskt r&#xe4;ttsst&#xf6;d till Laos, genom multi-bi-avtal med UNDP f&#xf6;r 2000-2003, p&#xe5; SEK 1 miljon. Huvudinriktning i projektet &#xe4;r utbildningsinsatser f&#xf6;r domare, f&#xf6;r attst&#xe4;rka deras juridiska kompetens s&#xe5;v&#xe4;l som kunskap om nya lagar, procedurer, mm</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the People&apos;s Supreme Court (PSC) in Laos, through a multi- bilateral agreement with UNDP, of SEK 1 mill. f&#xf6;r 2000-2003 (3 years).The main objective of the project is to, through education and traininof judges, strengthen their legal competence as well as knowledge abounew laws, procedures etc</narrative>
